    {
      "id": "ResortAreaRibbonSyndicate1F_Text_CollectLotsOfRibbons",
      "en_US": [
        "...Sniff...\n",
        "I do apologize.\r",
        "This is an exclusive establishment\n",
        "open only to a select few.\r",
        "You might consider it a special stage\n",
        "for the cream of the crop.\r",
        "If you wish to enter, I suggest you\n",
        "start by collecting lots of Ribbons.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Peuh...\n",
        "Je regrette.\r",
        "Cet établissement de haute \n",
        "tenue est réservé à l’élite.\r",
        "La crème de la crème, pour parler \n",
        "vulgairement. Hu, hu, hu!\r",
        "Si vous voulez en faire partie, vous\n",
        "devez posséder beaucoup de Rubans.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ResortAreaRibbonSyndicate1F_Text_YouMustJoinUs",
      "en_US": [
        "...Sniff...\n",
        "I do apologize.\r",
        "This is an exclusive establishment\n",
        "open only to a select few.\r",
        "You might consider it a special stage\n",
        "for the cream of the crop.\r",
        "If you wish to enter, I suggest you\n",
        "start by collecting lots of Ribbons...\r",
        "...Wait! Oh, my gosh!\n",
        "Look at all your Ribbons!\r",
        "I truly apologize for my rudeness.\n",
        "It’s so out of character for me!\r",
        "If you would be so kind, we would\n",
        "be honored to invite you...\r",
        "Oh, no, no! You really must join us\n",
        "as a full-fledged member!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} was made a member\n",
        "without any say in the decision!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Peuh...\n",
        "Je regrette.\r",
        "Cet établissement de haute \n",
        "tenue est réservé à l’élite.\r",
        "La crème de la crème, pour parler \n",
        "vulgairement. Hu, hu, hu!\r",
        "Si vous voulez en faire partie, vous\n",
        "devez posséder beaucoup de...\r",
        "Attendez un peu... \n",
        "Diantre, regardez tous ces Rubans!\r",
        "Vraiment, excusez mon impolitesse,\n",
        "je me suis égarée!\r",
        "Oh, je vous en prie, acceptez de \n",
        "faire partie de notre club!\r",
        "Oh, et puis au diable les convenances,\n",
        "je vous déclare membre sur le champ!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} est maintenant \n",
        "membre du Club Rubans!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ResortAreaRibbonSyndicate1F_Text_LookedForwardSeeingYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome! We’ve looked forward to\n",
        "seeing you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I do hope you will enjoy the luxurious\n",
        "atmosphere and services that only\f",
        "we can provide."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue! Nous vous attendions \n",
        "avec impatience, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "J’espère que vous saurez apprécier \n",
        "l’atmosphère luxueuse et les différents\f",
        "services que nous proposons."
      ]
    },
    {
