      "en_US": [
        "Welcome.\r",
        "May I interest you in top-grade\n",
        "Ribbons we had specially imported?\r",
        "These Ribbons are available only\n",
        "through us.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, would you like one\n",
        "for a Pokémon, perhaps?\r",
        "Right now, I can offer you\n",
        "the Gorgeous Ribbon.\r",
        "For a mere $10,000, you can be the\n",
        "proud owner of one."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue.\r",
        "Voulez-vous voir nos Rubans de première\n",
        "qualité importés par nos soins?\r",
        "Nous sommes les seuls à \n",
        "les proposer à la vente.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, je pense que vos Pokémon\n",
        "méritent ce qu’il y a de mieux.\r",
        "Je peux vous proposer le \n",
        "Ruban Sublime.\r",
        "Il est à vous pour la modique \n",
